{"id":"bdf91bc7ddbdd903","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md","title":"$L$ Satisfies GCH","display":"thm-L-satisfies-GCH — $L$ Satisfies GCH","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH","aliases":["58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH","GCH holds in L"],"display":"thm-L-satisfies-GCH — $L$ Satisfies GCH","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-gch.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[./58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH</span><span>GCH holds in L</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-L-satisfies-GCH — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> Satisfies GCH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-gch.md\">../batch08/58-df-gch.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cfa29222af6471b2\" href=\"?note=cfa29222af6471b2\" title=\"./58-df-l-hierarchy.md\">58-df-l-hierarchy.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-gch.md\">../batch08/58-df-gch.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(L\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span> denotes metatheoretic truth in the proper-class structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\in)\">\\((L,\\in)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}L\\text{-}satisfies\\text{-}GCH} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} L \\models_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GCH}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}L\\text{-}satisfies\\text{-}GCH} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} L \\models_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GCH}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Godel's original result (1938): <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> satisfies GCH; the subscript marks proper-class satisfaction as metatheoretic rather than applying the set-coded structure predicate to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Key mechanism: condensation restricts where subsets can appear.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is &quot;thin&quot;: fewer subsets than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V \\neq L\">\\(V \\neq L\\)</span>).</li>\n<li>GCH may fail in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (by forcing), but holds in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Foundation for: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V = L\">\\(V = L\\)</span> implies GCH, diamond, etc.</li>\n<li>Shoenfield absoluteness uses similar condensation arguments.</li>\n<li>Equivalent metatheoretic expansion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L \\models_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\forall \\alpha\\;(2^{\\aleph_\\alpha} = \\aleph_{\\alpha+1})\">\\(L \\models_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\forall \\alpha\\;(2^{\\aleph_\\alpha} = \\aleph_{\\alpha+1})\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-gch.md","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-gch.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-l-hierarchy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfa29222af6471b2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathsf{Cls}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-gch.md","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-gch.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{GCH}","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}L\\t